original_caption:
Two-layer authentication system operation when the reference channel is in effect. From the outputs $
ChOutRef$ and $
ChOutDeg$ of the degraded broadcast reference channel, corresponding to mild and harsh editing, the respective fine and coarse authentic reconstructions $ ul{
Srch_{\mathrm{f}}}$ and $ ul{
Srch_{\mathrm{c}}}$ are produced. The common encoding obtained from the source $ ul{
Src}$ is $ ul{
ChIn}$.

